(415,203,$mw$595C85529AA06101170B1F22AD7AFD1B0108109E0F3E1200290289D0ED94DDAC$mw$,$mw$4194085d5a003ef3786314c5651b2fb0$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":203,"StageId":1,"CategoryId":3,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"ما محيط مستطيل طوله 11 سم وعرضه 8 سم؟","TitleEn":"Find the perimeter of a 11 cm by 8 cm rectangle.","QuestionTextAr":"ما محيط مستطيل طوله 11 سم وعرضه 8 سم؟","QuestionTextEn":"Find the perimeter of a 11 cm by 8 cm rectangle.","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: محيط المستطيل = 2 × (الطول + العرض)، لأن لكل بُعد ضلعين متساويين. المعطيات 11 سم و8 سم؛ نجمع 11 + 8 = 19 سم ثم نضاعف: 2 × 19 = 38 سم. المحيط طول الحدود الخارجية وليس مساحة.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Rectangle perimeter = 2 × (length + width), as each side length occurs twice. Given 11 cm and 8 cm, add 11 + 8 = 19 cm, then double: 2 × 19 = 38 cm. Perimeter measures distance around the shape.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":801,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"38","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":802,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"39","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":803,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"41","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":804,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"36","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"المحيط هو طول الحدود الخارجية.","En":"Perimeter measures the outside boundary."},{"Ar":"لكل من الطول والعرض ضلعان متساويان.","En":"There are two sides of each dimension."}],"Title":{"Ar":"حساب محيط مستطيل","En":"Calculating rectangle perimeter"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"38"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"جمع الأضلاع الأربعة يعطي 38 سم، لا 39.","En":"Adding all four sides gives 38 cm, not 39."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"39"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"جمع الأضلاع الأربعة يعطي 38 سم، لا 41.","En":"Adding all four sides gives 38 cm, not 41."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"41"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"جمع الأضلاع الأربعة يعطي 38 سم، لا 36.","En":"Adding all four sides gives 38 cm, not 36."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"36"}],"StageId":1,"Question":{"Ar":"ما محيط مستطيل طوله 11 سم وعرضه 8 سم؟","En":"Find the perimeter of a rectangle measuring 11 cm by 8 cm."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"المحيط مجموع أطوال الأضلاع الأربعة.","En":"Perimeter is the sum of the four side lengths."},"Unit":{"Ar":"سم","En":"cm"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"$l+w=11+8=19$","En":"$l+w=11+8=19$"},{"Ar":"$P=2\\cdot19=38$","En":"$P=2\\cdot19=38$"}],"Result":{"Ar":"$38$","En":"$38$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تستخدم قانون المساحة لحساب المحيط.","En":"Do not use the area formula for perimeter."},"FormulaLatex":"P=2(l+w)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$P=2(11+8)=38$","En":"$P=2(11+8)=38$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$11+8+11+8=38$","En":"$11+8+11+8=38$"}},"TrackIds":[3],"CategoryId":3,"PrimarySkillId":12,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"المحيط هو طول الحدود الخارجية.","En":"Perimeter measures the outside boundary."},{"Ar":"لكل من الطول والعرض ضلعان متساويان.","En":"There are two sides of each dimension."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"المحيط مجموع أطوال الأضلاع الأربعة.","En":"Perimeter is the sum of the four side lengths."},"Unit":{"Ar":"سم","En":"cm"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"$l+w=11+8=19$","En":"$l+w=11+8=19$"},{"Ar":"$P=2\\cdot19=38$","En":"$P=2\\cdot19=38$"}],"Result":{"Ar":"$38$","En":"$38$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تستخدم قانون المساحة لحساب المحيط.","En":"Do not use the area formula for perimeter."},"FormulaLatex":"P=2(l+w)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$P=2(11+8)=38$","En":"$P=2(11+8)=38$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$11+8+11+8=38$","En":"$11+8+11+8=38$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"جمع الأضلاع الأربعة يعطي 38 سم، لا 39.","En":"Adding all four sides gives 38 cm, not 39."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"جمع الأضلاع الأربعة يعطي 38 سم، لا 41.","En":"Adding all four sides gives 38 cm, not 41."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"جمع الأضلاع الأربعة يعطي 38 سم، لا 36.","En":"Adding all four sides gives 38 cm, not 36."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$المحيط مجموع أطوال الأضلاع الأربعة.

$P=2(l+w)$

1. $l+w=11+8=19$

2. $P=2\cdot19=38$

$P=2(11+8)=38$

$38$ سم

$11+8+11+8=38$

لا تستخدم قانون المساحة لحساب المحيط.$mw$,$mw$Perimeter is the sum of the four side lengths.

$P=2(l+w)$

1. $l+w=11+8=19$

2. $P=2\cdot19=38$

$P=2(11+8)=38$

$38$ cm

$11+8+11+8=38$

Do not use the area formula for perimeter.$mw$),
